<title>USA: Leavenworth, Kan., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Leavenworth, Kan., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc said it won $2.550 million of Leavenworth, Kan., general obligation bonds, Series 1997A and 1997B, with a net interest cost of 5.09 percent.</p>
</text>
